wenshu = generic writing assistant, not just novels. The 7/17 草稿 covered
小说创作; this 7/24 rewrite expands to 通用写作 (novels + business copy +
academic + email + ...). The core philosophy: 法无定法 — the 7-step node
framework is fixed, but the methodology at each step is chosen by the user.

This commit drops 4 files into wenshu/ to make the writing-assistant identity
operational:

- wenshu/SOUL.md (~6KB)
    Identity: 文枢 = 通用写作助手 forked from Hermes Agent v0.19.0 (MIT).
    Environment: based on hermes-agent deep fork, "文枢" from 文曲星.
    Work: 辅助用户利用方法论写作 (法无定法).
    4 维 core capabilities (active research / rational advice / consistency
    guard / reverse advice) + project directory convention (README + settings/
    + chapters/ + notes/ + drafts/) + tool/permission boundaries.

- wenshu/AGENTS.md (~7KB)
    7-step 通用节点 framework — each step is a slot, not a lock:
      Step 1 read project → Step 2 调研 (auto-ask / pull-existing / skip)
                            → Step 3 拉资料 (search / fetch / model-generate)
                            → Step 4 consistency check (4 dims)
                            → Step 5 创作输出 (drafted / user-approved / passed)
                            → Step 6 reverse advice (3 dimensions)
                            → Step 7 user-拍 / change / continue
    Each step explicitly says "用户可注入方法论" — the user picks the
    methodology per step (12 hits in this file).

- wenshu/methodologies/README.md (~1KB)
    Library architecture for 法无定法. Each methodology lives as one .md
    file under wenshu/methodologies/, the agent scans the directory at boot
    and exposes the methods to the user. Subdirectories by category
    (foundations/ character/ chinese/ modern/ examples/). Future WO can
    add the full 30 methodologies (5 from aif 私域 + 25 from 市面 经典,
    158 stages + 42 atoms ≈ 479 fragments).

- wenshu/methodologies/examples/scqa-storytelling.md (~1.5KB)
    First shipped example: Barbara Minto's SCQA story arc (Situation →
    Complication → Question → Answer), applied to business writing. Future
    examples will include Hero's Journey, Three-Act, Snowflake, 金字塔原理,
    AIDA, PAS, StoryBrand, 5W1H, IMRaD, etc.

Staging range: wenshu/ (4 new files, ~16KB total)

